The bones file is removed as soon as it is loaded.  Just be
careful not to die on that level once it's loaded, and it's
gone; i.e. as soon as you see that it's the ugly bones, run away
to some other level, and either come back when you're strong
enough to handle it, or die trying.  Either way, you'll never
see that bones again.  (Formally, you'll never see that
particular bones file again, regardless.  But if you die on that
level, you may generate a new bones file, will everything you
didn't like still in it.)

