Maybe, but IIRC, he said that the bones was in the mines.  If
that's the case, he always has the option of continuing down the
main branch once he sees the bones, with the hope of getting
strong enough to handle it (or maybe by then, it won't be worth
the bother of going into the mines).  And if he dies before
then, the bones file is gone anyway, so he's at least
accomplished something.

